<h3 align="start" nodeId="b182c4aaa0d14587a9882ece15313a43">一、背景</h3>
<p align="start" nodeId="72609c7494614ca986d3d41db8e44e54">在画布类策略部署的时候，存在需要将执行过程中某些关键数据进行外存。</p>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="0f0f5bcaf99d4120a51a9e2f64ef997e">二、名词解释</h3>
<p nodeId="8a10d9a668454744b0916c12a303adda">无</p>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="bf1dedf834064a39b66468fb30509720">三、操作指南</h3>
<p nodeId="c4b65bf8d27f444aa4fcb0ef418a6a69"><a href="https://mis.zeus.rc.st.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/paint/detail?id=175&amp;version=1" nodeId="bd709258b78146d1b149231463115e5a"></a>目前数据存储仅支持squrrile存储（<strong>仅支持redis-rc-public_product集群</strong>）</p>
<km-drawio src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1316510919/1878237787?contentType=0&amp;isNewContent=false" width="696" height="326" nodeId="57476d8a97414baca942bf7052102c87" />
